WEBVTT

00:00:29.358 --> 00:00:32.236
on the traditional lands
of the Yup’ik and Cup’ik people.

00:00:33.404 --> 00:00:37.366
And we were up there
hauling hundreds of pounds of equipment

00:00:37.366 --> 00:00:41.245
across the tundra in the middle
of a record-breaking heatwave.

00:00:42.205 --> 00:00:44.415
It was 90 degrees Fahrenheit.

00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.250
There was no breeze,

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.502
nowhere to go for a shade

00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:51.964
and seemingly endless miles of tundra
as far as my eyes could see.

00:00:53.216 --> 00:00:54.300
To make matters worse,

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.302
the land had drastically changed

00:00:56.302 --> 00:00:58.429
since we had been here
just one year before.

00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:01.849
The ground was sinking
and it was cracking.